{"root":{"data":{"id":"dle40c1pbsw0","created":1789294627248,"text":"数据链路层"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4i443eqo0","created":1789296020533,"text":"组帧（封装成帧）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4it13k680","created":1789296074771,"text":"主要问题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4j5826gw0","created":1789296101314,"text":"帧定界"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4j9tdppk0","created":1789296111310,"text":"如何让接收方能够确定帧的界限"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dle4j79r1tc0","created":1789296105770,"text":"透明传输"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dle4jbuxds00","created":1789296115757,"text":"- 接收方链路层能够从收到的帧内恢复原始 SDU，让网络层“感受不到”将分组封装成帧的过程"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dle4jbuxboo0","created":1789296115757,"text":"- 接收方能够去除“帧定界”的附加信息，把帧“恢复原貌”"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dle4j0galpc0","created":1789296090928,"text":"四种组帧方法"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}